### FoodBridge API — manual smoke tests
### Install the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client), then click
### "Send Request" above any block below. Run `npm run seed` first so these logins exist.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health check — should return { status: "ok" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login as a donor — copy the returned token into @donorToken below
# @name donorLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "donor1@foodbridge.app",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login as an NGO — copy the returned token into @ngoToken below
# @name ngoLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ngo1@foodbridge.app",
  "password": "password123"
}

@donorToken = PASTE_DONOR_TOKEN_HERE
@ngoToken = PASTE_NGO_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Donor posts a new listing
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodType": "Test batch — samosas",
  "description": "Manual smoke test listing",
  "quantityKg": 5,
  "expiryAt": "2026-12-31T18:00:00.000Z",
  "pickupLocation": { "address": "Connaught Place, New Delhi", "lat": 28.6315, "lng": 77.2167 }
}

### 5. NGO browses open listings
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?status=posted
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}

### 6. NGO claims a listing — replace LISTING_ID with an _id from step 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings/LISTING_ID/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}

### 7. Mark picked up (as the claiming NGO)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/LISTING_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "picked_up" }

### 8. Mark delivered (donor or NGO)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/LISTING_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "delivered" }

### 9. Download the free single-donation certificate (opens as binary PDF — use "Save Response Body")
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/LISTING_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}

### 10. Try the Pro-only consolidated CSR report — should 402 unless donor.plan === 'pro'
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/csr-report
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}

### 11. Check billing status
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/status
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}

### 12. Demo-upgrade to Pro (only works when RAZORPAY_KEY_ID is NOT set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/confirm-demo-upgrade
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}

### 13. NGO route optimizer (needs 2+ claimed/picked_up listings to be interesting)
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes/optimize
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}

### 14. Demand hotspot predictions
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions/hotspots
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}
